{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1544","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"一棵树在雨中走动","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"在倾洒的灰色中匆匆走过我们身边","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"它有急事。它汲取雨中的生命","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"就像果园里的黑鹂","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"雨停歇。树停下脚步","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"它在晴朗的夜晚挺拔地静闪","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"和我们一样它在等待那瞬息","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"当雪花在空中绽开","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"歌德的诗《迷娘》（之一）运用众多意象，构建起了一个迷离而又优美、令人神往的境界。反复出现的“前往”，犹如一声声急切的呼唤，拨动着读者的心弦。反复朗读，感受诗歌回环往复的声韵之美，体会其浓郁的抒情氛围。作曲家贝多芬、舒伯特、舒曼、柴可夫斯基等都曾经为这首诗谱过曲，可以找来欣赏。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"《致大海》写于1824 年。当时，普希金遭遇放逐，从黑海之滨的敖德萨来到俄国外省一个偏僻的村庄，但沙皇的严厉惩罚并未动摇诗人心中对自由和正义的渴望。诗中辽阔而又自由、深沉而又有力、骄傲而又倔强的大海，正是诗人反抗意志的象征。阅读时，要注意体会这首诗歌内在情绪的起伏跌宕，理解其中对现实和自我的思考，感受诗人在重重束缚下迸发出的斗争激情。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"郭沫若曾盛赞惠特曼是一位犹如“太平洋一样”（《晨安》）广阔的诗人。惠特曼的诗歌意境开阔，气魄宏大，有一种质朴而明朗的力量，本课选的这一节《自己之歌》，就充分展现了这一特点。朗读这首诗，感受其中涌动的旺盛的生命之力和诗中凸显出的那个宏大的自我。诗中列举的许多自然事物，在传统的诗歌中很少出现，惠特曼则赋予这些事物以诗意。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"《树和天空》的想象十分奇特，意境似乎也有点儿朦胧，仿佛关联着多方面的主题，如自然的生生不息、人与自然的关系、生命的奇迹等；但又很难读解，不好把握。阅读时，不要逐字逐句推敲索解，而要运用想象，尝试进入诗歌所创造的那个奇异的世界。诗中这棵“在雨中走动”的树，结尾那“在空中绽开”的雪花，是否给你带来了新鲜的感受？","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《特朗斯特罗姆诗全集》（南海出版公司2001年版）。李笠译。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"特朗斯特罗姆（1931—2015），瑞典诗人。获2011 年诺贝尔文学奖。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e6%a0%91%e5%92%8c%e5%a4%a9%e7%a9%ba-%e7%89%b9%e6%9c%97%e6%96%af%e7%89%b9%e7%bd%97%e5%a7%86","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e6%a0%91%e5%92%8c%e5%a4%a9%e7%a9%ba-%e7%89%b9%e6%9c%97%e6%96%af%e7%89%b9%e7%bd%97%e5%a7%86","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e6%a0%91%e5%92%8c%e5%a4%a9%e7%a9%ba-%e7%89%b9%e6%9c%97%e6%96%af%e7%89%b9%e7%bd%97%e5%a7%86","title":null}],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10325,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e6%a0%91%e5%92%8c%e5%a4%a9%e7%a9%ba-%e7%89%b9%e6%9c%97%e6%96%af%e7%89%b9%e7%bd%97%e5%a7%86","postId":10325,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e6%a0%91%e5%92%8c%e5%a4%a9%e7%a9%ba-%e7%89%b9%e6%9c%97%e6%96%af%e7%89%b9%e7%bd%97%e5%a7%86","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/%e6%a0%91%e5%92%8c%e5%a4%a9%e7%a9%ba-%e7%89%b9%e6%9c%97%e6%96%af%e7%89%b9%e7%bd%97%e5%a7%86","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-10329-h-1","postId":10329,"postNumber":5,"postRole":"discussion","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-10329-h-1","text":"#p-10329-h-1","title":null}],"media":[],"posts":[{"cookedSha256":"095cf7ef69fecdc4987dc7c08e8bc47d3ee0188e5f898b1a1ab4074769e20699","createdAt":"2024-08-09T09:10:58Z","plainTextSha256":"dc3118b3298896064afd057d79569edfb2b7da1c7e4ef686b833f6fcd361bb0d","postId":10325,"postNumber":1,"replyToPostNumber":null,"role":"primary","updatedAt":"2025-02-15T04:21:58Z"},{"cookedSha256":"7342d95f9207996f46bee7afeb54eb34ed499b5dd0f55f801acf838f5141a476","createdAt":"2024-08-09T09:13:0